s conversation exist is because this exact "basic" thought has done immense damage for generations. It’s not being shut down out of political correctness; it’s being shut down because it’s the precise mechanism of a form of discrimination that holds millions back. So yes, there are bigger, more violent injustices in the world. But fighting this one is not a distraction—it’s addressing one of the primary ways gender inequality is transmitted quietly through normal life. You stumbled into a line that matters. I’m not trying to lecture you. I’m trying to show you why that line is a tripwire.
